'''Icecrusher''' is an [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Icecrusher Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]]. When purchased, it initially starts as a rare knife, but as the player gains XP [[File:XP Symbol.png|25px|link=XP]], it evolves into a knife of a higher rarity. Once purchased, it cannot be [[Trading|traded]] to other users.

==Appearance==
=== Variant 1 ===
The first variant uses the same mesh as the [[Default Knife]]. Its blade is constructed out of bright blue cracked ice. The guard is silver and the handle is purple. The knife is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] in this stage.

=== Variant 2 ===
The second variant of this knife is quite similar to the previous stage. The blade is still constructed out of bright blue ice, but it is no longer cracked. On the spine of the blade is a silver frame with an ice crystal by the ricasso. The guard is silver, and the handle is wrapped in purple tape. The knife is now a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] in this stage.

=== Variant 3 ===
The third variant of this knife turns into a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] with a different mesh. Its blade is made out of a long, jagged, bright blue ice shard in a polygonal shape. The guard has a piece of ice in a silver hexagon prong with two triangle-shaped ice shards attached to each side. The thin handle, attached to the prong, is wrapped in purple tape with a small pointed ice pommel below it. It has a similar shape to a weapon under the name of [[Gemstone|Gemstone.]] 

=== Variant 4 ===
The fourth final variant of the knife is where it turns into an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]]. It appears to resemble a double headed war hammer with each head being encased in bright blue ice. In the center of the hammer is a gray skull with icy blue eyes, a thin, black nose, and sharp silver teeth. Surrounding the skull is a silver diamond with five arrowheads coming out from each side. The arrowhead in the center has a diamond-shaped ice in it. The thin handle, attached to the bottom of the silver diamond, is wrapped in purple fabric with a sharp, icy arrowhead at the bottom.

==Trivia== 
*It is the second [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] weapon to be released in the game, the first being [[Reaver]].
*This is the only [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] weapon that does not resemble a scythe once fully evolved.
*This, [[Reaver]], [[Gingerscythe]], and [[Synthwave]] are the only gamepass knives to be untradeable.
*It requires 864,000 XP [[File:XP Symbol.png|25px|link=XP]] to get the knife to [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]].
*It has a partner gun under the name [[Icepiercer]].
**It's also partners with the ancient knife [[Icebreaker]] and the godly gun [[Iceblaster]], however, it is not a part of the Full Ice Set.
* There are [[Red Icecrusher|red]], [[Bronze Icecrusher|bronze]], [[Silver Icecrusher|silver]], and [[Gold Icecrusher|gold]] reskin variants of this knife, which were awarded as [[Unique Weapons|unique]] trophies for placing in the top 100 during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]].
* It is the very first [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] weapon to have leaderboard variants, others being [[Gingerscythe]], and [[Synthwave]].
*All the variants were designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

